        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Cornish, Steven Moffat, Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, Paul Rudd, Matt Besser, Amy Poehler, Ian Roberts, Matt Walsh, Rick Roman, Horatio Sanz, Drew Franklin\n- Works: Ant-Man, The Kid Who Would Be King, Saturday Night Live\n- Organizations: Upright Citizens Brigade, NBC\n\nFacts:\n- Adam McKay served as head writer for the NBC sketch comedy series Saturday Night Live for two seasons.\n- The original incarnation of Upright Citizens Brigade consisted of Matt Besser, Amy Poehler, Ian Roberts, Matt Walsh, Adam McKay, Rick Roman, Horatio Sanz, and Drew Franklin, whose picture is the UCB logo.\n- Joe Cornish co-wrote Ant-Man with Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, and Paul Rudd.\n- The Kid Who Would Be King is an upcoming British-American adventure drama film directed and written by Joe Cornish.",
